    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to bring number 45 Boroimhe Cedars, Swords to the open market for sale. This spacious 2 bed, 2 bath ground-floor apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation and excellent potential, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to put their own stamp on a property. Ideally situated in a desirable residential location, the apartment benefits from its own private entrance and allocated parking. Requiring some refurbishment and updating, the property presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a home with potential. Offered to the market with vacant possession and no onward chain, it is ready for its new owner to make their mark.\n\nThe property comprises two bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, with the main bedroom benefiting from an en-suite bathroom. There is also a family bathroom, kitchen, and a bright open-plan living and dining area with an electric feature fireplace. Patio doors from the living area lead onto a small front patio. The property also benefits from one allocated parking space and an additional visitor parking space.\n\nBoroimhe is a highly sought after development on the south side of Swords. It offers a fantastic balance between being a warm and welcoming community, whilst being excellently located to take advantage of a wealth of shops and amenities in Boroimhe shopping centre, Airside retail park and Swords village. The Swords express bus has one of its final stops here before providing quick access into Dublin City Centre and being on the south side of Swords also means there is very easy access to the M1 motorway and Dublin International Airport.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.47m (4'10\") x 1.58m (5'2\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n\nLounge - 4.82m (15'10\") x 4.65m (15'3\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n-Feature gas fireplace with marble hearth and timber surround\n-Ceiling coving\n-Patio door\n\n\nKitchen - 1.87m (6'2\") x 3.37m (11'1\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n-With a range of matching floor and eye level fitted press units\n-Tiled splashbacks\n-Integrated appliances\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.79m (9'2\") x 4.19m (13'9\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobe\n-En-Suite\n\nEn-Suite - 1.45m (4'9\") x 1.49m (4'11\")\n-Tiled floor & partially tiled walls.\n-WC & WHB\n-Shower cubicle\n\nBedroom 2 - 1.93m (6'4\") x 3.79m (12'5\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 1.69m (5'7\") x 2.27m (7'5\")\n-Tiled floor & partially tiled walls\n-WC & WHB\n-Panel bath with overhead shower attachment\n\n"
